message: "Please cite this software and the component scientific sources in Documentation/References/references.bib."
type: software
title: "Cat Full-Body Neuromechanics: fixed-excitation forward dynamics"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
authors:
  - family-names: Rahmati
    given-names: Seyed Mohammadali
license: MIT
abstract: "Fully forward cat neuromusculoskeletal model with mechanically coupled sagittal four-limb dynamics. Prescribed muscle excitation drives activation dynamics, Hill-type active and passive muscle forces, viscous fiber damping, elastic tendons and compliant paw contact. Includes intact walking results, experimental comparisons, documented equations and parameters, and explicit biological and validation limitations."
keywords:
  - neuromechanics
  - forward dynamics
  - cat locomotion
  - elastic tendon
  - muscle excitation
